\nここは、東北好きが集まって、のんびり座って、しゃべって、笑って楽しむイベントです。\n初めての方も遠慮せず、気軽に楽しんでいってください！\n（最後に蕗之葉みもざ様のお名前を入れていただけると嬉しいです）」\n楽しい雰囲気で、秋田弁で読み上げていただけると嬉しいです。", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hukinoha_akita/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "voice", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 413220, "client_id": 3399527, "vtt_url": "https://fcdn.skeb.jp/uploads/outputs/66cc2e02-1615-415e-bc6a-471dd1beccae?response-content-disposition=inline&Expires=1774613277&Signature=QwvfcmPX0TOYnvHccP6fN18jHU8HmMr68plHXsW0hUoBrlLRUEKwIvcosMHaGk-JhlGsgHsRZewby2L-WDO-HsCS6B-jHryNldkELcq7fUak-6r-Z5jGT~n9ZtF9sfqXGWbRCRPYc92NXT1ZF6q03sICyF4~OYb3MVXuxtL2LuOH6HJcawlRVKwE5VWUsQdIylAJd9bY0HN3HcaCi2P9b~vedMg2GT-jv1zGGFVAF24mbt0ee7P0mNGfQTF2wTt3wzxkRKE~TDzOa1DWId1FtA1yzLvQcHTvB5bMWNlgt1req599ODvF6UKIXNSTkRosmyikQbSZIa9k3y3y7gKwxA__&Key-Pair-Id=K1GS3H53SEO647", "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1789218502953615360%2FIgQVqQM0.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=03cc59a3ef39a3d80a6e3401c63bdde5", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1789218502953615360%2FIgQVqQM0.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=03cc59a3ef39a3d80a6e3401c63bdde5, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1789218502953615360%2FIgQVqQM0.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=857e7823db3a3797fa87286961b050b3 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1789218502953615360%2FIgQVqQM0.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=af4e5317d3ecc7622e07dcc96d8f24d8 3x"}, "preview_url": "https://fcdn.skeb.jp/uploads/outputs/67d9fb24-a8c8-4273-9b7e-79f898eaabe6?response-content-disposition=inline&Expires=